  <body>
    <section id="main">
      <title><p>Formatting playground</p></title>
      <epigraph><p>Epigraph text.</p><text-author>Epigraph author</text-author></epigraph>
      <p>Ordinary paragraph with <strong>bold words</strong>, <emphasis>italic words</emphasis>, <strong><emphasis>mixed emphasis</emphasis></strong> and <strikethrough>deleted words</strikethrough>. This paragraph is deliberately long enough to wrap across several visual lines on narrow terminals. Привет, 中文, 👩‍💻.</p>
      <p>A second paragraph keeps its own first-line indent.</p>
      <p>A <style name="custom">named style retains <emphasis>nested emphasis</emphasis></style> without losing its text.</p>
      <subtitle>Quotation and verse</subtitle>
      <cite><p>Quoted paragraph.</p><text-author>Quote author</text-author></cite>
      <poem>
        <stanza><v>First verse line.</v><v>Second <emphasis>verse line</emphasis>.</v></stanza>
        <stanza><v>Next stanza line.</v><v>Last verse line.</v></stanza>
        <text-author>Poet name</text-author>
      </poem>
      <p><code>if (ready) {
  print("literal");
}</code></p>
      <empty-line/>
      <p>Footnote reference <a l:href="#note" type="note">[1]</a>.</p>
      <image l:href="#pixel"/>
      <section id="tables">
        <title><p>Tables and references</p></title>
        <table id="results">
          <tr><th rowspan="2">Name</th><th colspan="2">Measures</th></tr>
          <tr><th>Value</th><th>Reference</th></tr>
          <tr><td>中文 👩‍💻</td><td><strong>Bold cell</strong> with many words to exercise wrapping without losing content.</td><td><a l:href="#note" type="note">[1]</a></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Second</td><td><emphasis>Italic cell</emphasis></td><td><image l:href="#pixel"/></td></tr>
          <tr><td>Empty</td><td></td><td>Last cell</td></tr>
        </table>
        <p>Final paragraph.</p>
      </section>
    </section>
  </body>
  <body name="notes">
    <section id="note"><title><p>Note</p></title><p>Note body with <strong>bold note</strong>.</p></section>
  </body>
